        "text_8LWAxg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>Discover unforgettable experiential events with Rebel Nell's exceptional experiences, perfect for elevating any special occasion. Whether planning a creative team-building session, an engaging employee activity, a hands-on booth activation, an interactive attendee experience, a unique birthday celebration, or a memorable fundraising activity, Rebel Nell ensures a meaningful and impactful experience. </p><p>Explore our offerings and schedule your event today!</p>"
