      "blocks": {
        "text_block_KeGTQm": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/NSK.jpg",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Mural Making",
            "text": "<p>One of our most popular experiences. Our mural-making is  fun and engaging. We customize to meet your vision. This is perfect for team building (in-studio or off-site), annual meetings, weddings, milestone celebrations or networking events.</p>",
            "button_label": "Learn More",
            "button_link": "shopify://pages/diy-mural-making"
          }
        },
        "text_block_TbLH6e": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WEBSITE_TEMPLATES_Experiences_App_5_a116ed81-a22d-4478-bb2c-12b7f5778a5b.png",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Design Your Own Jewelry (Downtown Detroit)",
            "text": "<p>Looking for a new experience for a girls’ night out, or a fun get-together? Look no further. Our Design Your Own Jewelry is the perfect creative outlet for you and your friends. Join us in-store at our Parker's Alley location in Downtown Detroit. An experience you won't forget.</p>",
            "button_label": "Book Now",
            "button_link": "shopify://products/jewelry-designing-experience"
          }
        },
        "text_block_K9g7Dg": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Website_Experiences_Page_1_-min_25a6ac9b-c9fc-4623-b984-12bd789bc260.png",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Permanent Jewelry",
            "text": "<p>Hosting a bachelorette or girls' weekend in Detroit? Book a Permanent Jewelry Party at Rebel Nell! This jewelry is permanent (well, as long as you want it on, permanent), welded to your wrist or anklet by our creative designers.</p><p>Packages start at $75 per person</p>",
            "button_label": "Learn More",
            "button_link": "shopify://pages/limitless-bracelet-party"
          }
        },
        "text_block_WPghz4": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Website_Experiences_Page_2_-min_dc4765bc-3365-4cf4-b73d-846231ba0ef0.png",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "Pop-Ups/ Private Shopping",
            "text": "<p>Love Rebel Nell? Host a pop-up at your home or office! We'll bring the goodies to you (or you bring your friends to us). Great for Girl's Nights, a casual get-together, office lunch break or Sunday afternoon shopping party. And it's turnkey, pick your date, and we do the rest.</p><p>10% of sales or Rebel Nell jewelry for the hostess</p>",
            "button_label": "Learn More",
            "button_link": "shopify://pages/trunk-show"
          }
        }
      },
