        "text": "<p>Book the best of both worlds for your child's big day - a jewelry-making experience at Rebel Nell! We supply the tools, instruction, and finished piece(s), you bring the kids! A party like never before - your children will love it! Ideal for ages 8-16. We adjust the experience to meet the age group.</p><p>Packages start at $75 per person</p>",
